SUMMARY:[Curated Role Feeds] Fisheries of the Northeastern United States\;
  Atlantic Bluefish Fishery\; Quota Transfer From Rhode Island to North Car
 olina
DESCRIPTION:NMFS announces that the State of Rhode Island is transferring 
 a portion of their 2026 commercial bluefish quota to the State of North Ca
 rolina. This quota adjustment is necessary to comply with the Atlantic Blu
 efish Fishery Management Plan (FMP) quota transfer provisions. This announ
 cement informs the public of the revised 2026 commercial bluefish quotas f
 or Rhode Island and North Carolina.\nhttps://www.federalregister.gov/docum
 ents/2026/10/30/2026-22217/fisheries-of-the-northeastern-united-states-atl
 antic-bluefish-fishery-quota-transfer-from-rhode
URL:https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/2026/10/30/2026-22217/fisher
 ies-of-the-northeastern-united-states-atlantic-bluefish-fishery-quota-tran
 sfer-from-rhode
